Horizon Lite
============

An unofficial fork of Horizon (https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon), a from-scratch Rust
reimplementation of Minecraft: Java Edition 26.3.

This repository is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Mojang Studios, Microsoft,
the Horizon project, or its maintainers.

Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang Synergies AB. This repository contains no Minecraft code,
assets, jars, or prepared resources. All game content is read from the user's own installation
by `horizon-prepare`; prepared files live in `.local/` and are git-ignored.

Upstream copyright and the MIT license are preserved in LICENSE. Third-party notices are in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. The fork's own changes are released under the same MIT terms.

Do not open pull requests, issues, or support requests against the upstream project for anything
in this repository.
